 {
  "slug": "maggie-friends",
  "title": "Maggie & Friends",
  "date": "2019-09-26",
  "thumb": "4625",
  "group": "collaboration-projects",
  "tag": "Maggie & Friends",
  "desc": "<p>Collaboration project with Latvian cover band Maggie &amp; Friends. It was very exciting work together - and the results are on par with the process.  </p>",
  "blocks": [
   {
    "t": "img",
    "id": "4629"
   },
   {
    "t": "quote",
    "text": "Amazing musicians, which gave us inspiration to make original shots with different concepts. Ideas were floating in the air, we just had to catch them.",
    "author": ""
   },
   {
    "t": "set",
    "ids": [
     "4625",
     "4624",
     "4626",
     "4627"
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "set",
