     "4620",
     "4621"
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "text",
    "html": "<p>Every of them with his own passion, love and attitude to music. But together a unique band, full of expression and energy.</p>"
   },
   {
    "t": "set",
    "ids": [
     "4619",
     "4617",
     "4622",
     "4623"
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "set",
    "ids": [
     "4646",
     "4644",
     "4643",
     "4645"
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "text",
    "html": "<p>Maggie - vocalist, the engine of the whole team. Beautiful and inspiring woman, we've loved to work with.</p>"
   },
   {
    "t": "img",
    "id": "4647"
   },
   {
    "t": "img",
    "id": "4648"
   },
   {
    "t": "quote",
    "text": "Music is my passion\n\nWhen you're on the right track, everything flows naturally and you just have to use it respectively.",
