    "desc": "<p>Conceptional photo shoot with <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ziledesign/\">ZĪLE</a> new dress collection</p>",
    "side": "right"
   },
   {
    "t": "yt",
    "id": "YPKe3wABvj4",
    "title": "ZILE in motion"
   },
   {
    "t": "text",
    "html": "<p>The story of transformation, search, change. A story told by a series of photos, where we felt the relationship through different seasons and different moods with the help of two different images created from the same clothes.</p><p>We did something special together with the beautiful brand <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ziledesign/\">ZĪLE</a> - about how the masculine can turn into the feminine, about the relationship of these two portraits.</p><p>Many thanks to the designer for creating this beautiful clothes and for a small miracle when men's jeans turn into a jacket and a shirt into dress. This is truly an amazing feeling of rebirth.</p>"
   }
  ],
